  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On San Cha mountain, a four-clawed golden dragon tears black clouds with a roar that carries a long way. Ku Mo calls it a mere rank four golden dragon Gu and tears it down; a golden whirlwind from golden breeze Gu heals it before a jet-black halo from Wu Gui explodes it.",
        "chapters": [
          373
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "char_ku_mo",
          "char_wu_gui"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In northern plains, the rank four golden dragon Gu from southern border can only display the strength of a rank three Gu. One blow would have killed a poison beard wolf king in southern border; there Fang Yuan needs two uses, and the corpse stays intact.",
        "chapters": [
          426
        ],
